{{!-- home/testimonial.hbs — a learner quote.

     The design system's `.ns-testimonial`: __quote, then __who wrapping the
     __avatar, __name and __role. The theme used __body / __author / __stars,
     which is the same object under three different part names — so the app
     and the site drew the same quote differently.

     NO STAR ROW. The theme drew five filled stars on every quote, which is a
     rating nobody gave: Ghost has no review model behind it. The system's
     .ns-rating exists for when there is a real number; five hard-coded stars
     is decoration pretending to be data.

     Params: quote, name, role --}}
<figure class="ns-testimonial">
  <blockquote class="ns-testimonial__quote">{{quote}}</blockquote>
  <figcaption class="ns-testimonial__who">
    <span class="ns-avatar ns-avatar--sm ns-testimonial__avatar">{{> icons name="user"}}</span>
    <span>
      <span class="ns-testimonial__name">{{name}}</span>
      <span class="ns-testimonial__role">{{role}}</span>
    </span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
